clang 19 and later: Transpose has no derived().

The fix of Eigen 3.4.1: the operand itself.

--- a/eigen_cpp/lib/Eigen/src/Core/Transpositions.h
+++ b/eigen_cpp/lib/Eigen/src/Core/Transpositions.h
@@
-      return Product<OtherDerived, Transpose, AliasFreeProduct>(matrix.derived(), trt.derived());
+      return Product<OtherDerived, Transpose, AliasFreeProduct>(matrix.derived(), trt);
